Recommends: veltos-desktop
Description: VeltOS Weather, in the layout of Windows 11's Weather app
 The current weather over the sky of its condition, a 10-day forecast,
 an hourly chart (temperature, precipitation, wind, humidity, UV index,
 feels like, cloud cover, pressure, visibility), weather details (sun and
 moon, wind, humidity, UV index, air quality, visibility, pressure),
 historical weather (monthly averages of five years of records), favorite
 places and °F/°C, in English and Turkish.
 .
 Forecasts, air quality, place search and records come from Open-Meteo
 (open-meteo.com), an open-source weather service used without an
 account or a key; its data is licensed under CC BY 4.0.
